# Normalize line endings repo-wide: store LF in git, check out LF on every
# platform. Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true materializes
# CRLF and fights Prettier's endOfLine: lf — `prettier --check` then flags
# committed-clean files and the local lint gate diverges from CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalize.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
